#
# For a test build's model folder (web/dist.sh --model-base): upload it by hand as .htaccess into that folder, beside
# text-q8_0.gguf and mmproj-bf16.gguf. The folder holds a copy of the Hugging Face model, so reinstalling a test build
# does not count as a download on the Hub; this file keeps other sites and direct links from using the web space's
# bandwidth for it. Not a secret: anyone can send the header by hand.
# Needs Apache 2.4 with AllowOverride AuthConfig; a host that answers 500 does not allow Options here: drop that line.
# Modes on the server: the folder 755, the two .gguf files and this file 644 (750 / 640 where the web server runs in
# your group) — never writable by others (777 / 666).

# only the app's own pages may fetch it (browsers send Sec-Fetch-Site on every request): a link, the address bar or
# another site gets 403; range requests work
Require expr "%{HTTP:Sec-Fetch-Site} == 'same-origin'"
Options -Indexes
